Dear Singularitarians=2C

There is a kind of conversation that only happens when the right people si=
t in the same room=2C at the same time=2C working through a problem none o=
f them has fully solved yet.

The BGI Nexus June Virtual Event is almost here=2C and the full schedule i=
s set.

We=E2=80=99re proud to join the AI Collective for their global =E2=80=98Hu=
man in AI Week=E2=80=99 - asking questions about real systems being built=
 right now and how the elevate our individual and collective goals. This i=
s a conversation you want to be sitting in.

Date: June 01=2C 17:30 UTC =E2=80=94 Register Now (https://mailchi.mp/c968=
bfee6550/bgi-nexus-june-2026-virtual-event?mc_cid=3D2a756cea50&mc_eid=3DUN=
IQID)


** Full Event Schedule
------------------------------------------------------------

Event Opens=2C 17:30 UTC

Ben Goertzel=2C SingularityNET & OpenBGI; 30min - Opening Remarks

Prof Jeremy Pitt=2C Imperial College; 45min - =E2=80=9CHistory of Multi-Ag=
ent Systems: The Good=2C The Bad=2C and The Ugly=E2=80=9D

