Moderated Discussion Panel=2C 60min
* Moderator: Mihaela Ulieru=2C
* Participants:
+ Ben Goertzel=2C SingularityNET
+ Anna Mikeda=2C Independent Researcher
+ Kai Bickle=2C OpenBGI
+ Final Guest TBA!

BGI Nexus Working Group Presentations=2C 50min
* CURAD BGI Platform
* MMMO's
* BGI in Africa Development
* AI Safety & Ethics / Ethics Agent

Community Discussion Breakout Sessions=2C 45min - Topics TBA

Post-discussions Wrap-up and Closing
SIGN UP (https://mailchi.mp/c968bfee6550/bgi-nexus-june-2026-virtual-event=
